<title>GERMANY: TABLE - AMB details H1 97 figures.</title>
<headline>TABLE - AMB details H1 97 figures.</headline>
<dateline>AACHEN, Germany 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   131     vs 126</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     176     vs 171</p>
<p>    Group premium income		     8,900   vs 8,600</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Accident/injury			   3,190   vs 3,180</p>
<p>     Life insurance			    4,800   vs 4,543</p>
<p>     Health insurance			  917     vs 833</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Aachener und Muenchener Beteiligungs AG (AMB).</p>
</text>
